  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">described more fully in Rambus&#x2019; periodic reports filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission. The Company undertakes no obligation to update forward-looking statements to reflect events or circumstances after the date hereof.</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Contact</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Desmond Lynch</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Senior Vice President, Finance and Chief Financial Officer</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(408) 462-8000</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">dlynch@rambus.com</font></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;line-height:1.38;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Source: Rambus Inc.</font></p></div>
